    <item>
      <title>[Linux] 设置快捷命令</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[Linux] 设置快捷命令</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="设置快捷命令">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%ae%be%e7%bd%ae%e5%bf%ab%e6%8d%b7%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4"></a>
设置快捷命令
</h1><h2 id="1检查终端是不是bash">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1%e6%a3%80%e6%9f%a5%e7%bb%88%e7%ab%af%e6%98%af%e4%b8%8d%e6%98%afbash"></a>
1.检查终端是不是bash
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">echo $SHELL
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="2-添加自动命令单个用户-bashrc">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e6%b7%bb%e5%8a%a0%e8%87%aa%e5%8a%a8%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4%e5%8d%95%e4%b8%aa%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7-bashrc"></a>
2. 添加自动命令(单个用户: <code>~/.bashrc</code>)
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">nano ~/.bashrc
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>文末加一行:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">alias nv=&#39;nvidia-smi&#39;
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="3-添加自动命令所有用户-etcbashbashrc">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e6%b7%bb%e5%8a%a0%e8%87%aa%e5%8a%a8%e5%91%bd%e4%bb%a4%e6%89%80%e6%9c%89%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7-etcbashbashrc"></a>
3. 添加自动命令(所有用户: <code>/etc/bash.bashrc</code>)
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">nano /etc/bash.bashrc
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>文末加一行:</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-09-05首发于<a href='https://byzhrichard.github.io/'>byzh的博客</a>，最后修改于2026-09-05</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>Linux</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

    <item>
      <title>[forge-1.20.1] 8.燃料</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/8.%E7%87%83%E6%96%99/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/8.%E7%87%83%E6%96%99/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[forge-1.20.1] 8.燃料</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="燃料modfuelitem">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e7%87%83%e6%96%99modfuelitem"></a>
燃料ModFuelItem
</h1><ul>
<li>1个物品要烧10秒, 也就是200tick</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="原版的燃料源码">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%8e%9f%e7%89%88%e7%9a%84%e7%87%83%e6%96%99%e6%ba%90%e7%a0%81"></a>
原版的燃料源码
</h2><p>在 <code>AbstractFurnaceBlockEntity.java</code> 中</p>
<h2 id="写法">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%86%99%e6%b3%95"></a>
写法
</h2><p><code>com/byzh/diverse_draw/item/custom/ModFuelItem.java</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">com.byzh.diverse_draw.item.custom</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.Item</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.item.crafting.RecipeType</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">org.jetbrains.annotations.Nullable</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">ModFuelItem</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">extends</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">Item</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">private</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">burnTime</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="c1">// 单位是 tick</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">ModFuelItem</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">Properties</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">pProperties</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">BurnTime</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="kd">super</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">pProperties</span><span class="p">);</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">this</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">burnTime</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">BurnTime</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// 重写 (这个方法来自 Item 的 IForgeItem接口, 是forge的扩展方法: 用于设置物品的燃烧时间)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nd">@Override</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">int</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">getBurnTime</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">ItemStack</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">itemStack</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nd">@Nullable</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">RecipeType</span><span class="o">&lt;?&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">recipeType</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">return</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">burnTime</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>
<p>IForgeItem接口内有很多很棒的方法</p>
        
        <hr><p>本文2026-09-05首发于<a href='https://byzhrichard.github.io/'>byzh的博客</a>，最后修改于2026-09-05</p>]]>
      </description>
      
        <category>forge-1.20.1</category>
      
    </item>
    
    

    <item>
      <title>[forge-1.20.1] 7.食物</title>
      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/7.%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/%E6%B8%B8%E6%88%8F/minecraft/forge-1.20.1/7.%E9%A3%9F%E7%89%A9/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[forge-1.20.1] 7.食物</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="食物">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e9%a3%9f%e7%89%a9"></a>
食物
</h1><ul>
<li>饥饿值</li>
<li>饱和度(要用苹果皮才看得到)</li>
</ul>
<blockquote>
<p>给自己20秒的<code>饥饿10</code>: <code>/effect give @s minecraft:hunger 20 9</code></p>
</blockquote>
<h4 id="写食物信息">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e5%86%99%e9%a3%9f%e7%89%a9%e4%bf%a1%e6%81%af"></a>
写食物信息
</h4><p><code>com/byzh/diverse_draw/item/ModFoods.java</code>:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">com.byzh.diverse_draw.item</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.effect.MobEffect</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.effect.MobEffectInstance</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.effect.MobEffects</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nn">net.minecraft.world.food.FoodProperties</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">class</span> <span class="nc">ModFoods</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// nutrition(3): 回复3点饥饿值 -&gt; 1.5个鸡腿</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="c1">// 3*0.7*2=4.2: 回复4.2点饱和度</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">CORN</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">Builder</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">nutrition</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">3</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">saturationMod</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">7f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">();</span><span class="o">+++</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">date</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="err">&#39;</span><span class="n">2026</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">09</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">05</span><span class="err">&#39;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">draft</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">false</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">math</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">mermaid</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kc">true</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">title</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="err">&#39;</span><span class="o">[</span><span class="n">x</span><span class="o">]</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">y</span><span class="err">&#39;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">categories</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">[</span><span class="sc">&#39;x&#39;</span><span class="o">]</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">tags</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">[]</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="o">+++</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">STRAWBERRY</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">Builder</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">nutrition</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">1</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">saturationMod</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">2f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">effect</span><span class="p">(()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">MobEffectInstance</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">MobEffects</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">MOVEMENT_SPEED</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">200</span><span class="p">),</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">2f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">();</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="kd">public</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">static</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">final</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">CHEESE</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">FoodProperties</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">Builder</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">nutrition</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">4</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="na">saturationMod</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">8f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">effect</span><span class="p">(()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">MobEffectInstance</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">MobEffects</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">JUMP</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">200</span><span class="p">),</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">2f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">effect</span><span class="p">(()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">-&gt;</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">new</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">MobEffectInstance</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">MobEffects</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">FIRE_RESISTANCE</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">200</span><span class="p">),</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">0</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">2f</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="p">.</span><span class="na">build</span><span class="p">();</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id="注册为食物">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%b3%a8%e5%86%8c%e4%b8%ba%e9%a3%9f%e7%89%a9"></a>
注册为食物
</h4><p>在 <code>ModItems.java</code> 里补充:</p>
        
