      <link>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85conda/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 04 Sep 2026 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@example.com (byzh)</author>
      <guid>https://byzhrichard.github.io/post/linux/%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85conda/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>[Linux] 安装conda</h1><p>作者：byzh（xxx@example.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="linux-安装conda">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#linux-%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85conda"></a>
[Linux] 安装conda
</h1><h2 id="1-下载-miniconda-安装脚本">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#1-%e4%b8%8b%e8%bd%bd-miniconda-%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85%e8%84%9a%e6%9c%ac"></a>
1. 下载 Miniconda 安装脚本
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">cd /tmp
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">wget https://repo.anaconda.com/miniconda/Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="2-以-root-权限安装到-optconda">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#2-%e4%bb%a5-root-%e6%9d%83%e9%99%90%e5%ae%89%e8%a3%85%e5%88%b0-optconda"></a>
2. 以 root 权限安装到 /opt/conda
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo bash Miniconda3-latest-Linux-x86_64.sh
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>-&gt; 安装路径改成 <code>/opt/conda</code></p>
<h2 id="3-设置权限让所有用户都能读和执行">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#3-%e8%ae%be%e7%bd%ae%e6%9d%83%e9%99%90%e8%ae%a9%e6%89%80%e6%9c%89%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7%e9%83%bd%e8%83%bd%e8%af%bb%e5%92%8c%e6%89%a7%e8%a1%8c"></a>
3. 设置权限，让所有用户都能读和执行
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo chmod -R 755 /opt/conda
</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id="4-创建一个全局-profile-文件-给所有用户加-path">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#4-%e5%88%9b%e5%bb%ba%e4%b8%80%e4%b8%aa%e5%85%a8%e5%b1%80-profile-%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6-%e7%bb%99%e6%89%80%e6%9c%89%e7%94%a8%e6%88%b7%e5%8a%a0-path"></a>
4. 创建一个全局 profile 文件, 给所有用户加 PATH
</h2><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">sudo nano /etc/profile.d/conda.sh
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>/etc/profile.d/conda.sh</code>:</p>
        
